---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const adsenseClientId = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_ADSENSE_CLIENT_ID;
const adsenseEnabled = import.meta.env.PROD && adsenseClientId;
const gaMeasurementId = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_GA4_MEASUREMENT_ID;
---

<Layout title="Coretaker | Detalle del Juego | Ludik Hub" description="Conoce todo sobre Coretaker, el juego de acción y supervivencia táctica desarrollado por Ludik Studios." lang="es" adsenseClientId={adsenseEnabled ? adsenseClientId : undefined} gaMeasurementId={gaMeasurementId}>
	<main class="game-detail-shell">
		<!-- BOTÓN REGRESAR -->
		<div class="nav-back">
			<a href="/" class="btn-back">
				<span aria-hidden="true">←</span> Volver al Hub
			</a>
		</div>

		<!-- ENCABEZADO DEL JUEGO -->
		<header class="detail-header">
			<div class="header-badge">DETALLES DEL PROYECTO</div>
			<h1>CORE<em>TAKER</em></h1>
			<p class="tagline">Defensa táctica, reflejos y supervivencia en el espacio profundo.</p>
		</header>

		<!-- CONTENIDO PRINCIPAL -->
		<section class="detail-content">
			<article class="main-info">
				<h2>Sobre el juego</h2>
				<p>
					<strong>Coretaker</strong> es una intensa experiencia de acción y defensa estratégica desarrollada por Ludik Studios. Tu misión es salvaguardar el núcleo energético de la estación espacial frente a continuas amenazas y anomalías cósmicas, adaptando tu táctica en cada segundo de la batalla.
				</p>

				<h3>Características clave</h3>
				<ul>
					<li><strong>Defensa de núcleo en tiempo real:</strong> Protege el generador central administrando recursos y posicionamiento.</li>
					<li><strong>Acción rápida y reflejos:</strong> Enfrenta patrones de ataque dinámicos que pondrán a prueba tu agilidad mental.</li>
					<li><strong>Progresión y desafío constante:</strong> Cada oleada incrementa la dificultad exigiendo mayor precisión.</li>
					<li><strong>Construido en Unity WebGL:</strong> Disfruta de una experiencia fluida sin descargas adicionales directamente desde el navegador.</li>
				</ul>

				<!-- MULTIMEDIA: VIDEOS E IMÁGENES -->
				<section class="game-media-section">
					<h3>Multimedia</h3>
					<p class="media-intro">Trailers, demostraciones de gameplay y capturas de pantalla de Coretaker.</p>

					<!-- VIDEO / TRAILER -->
					<div class="media-block">
						<h4>Video / Trailer</h4>
						<div class="media-slot media-slot--video">
							<div class="media-placeholder">
								<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="36" height="36" fill="currentColor">
									<path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/>
								</svg>
								<strong>Trailer o Video de Gameplay</strong>
								<span>Espacio reservado para video (YouTube, Vimeo o archivo .mp4)</span>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- CAPTURAS DE PANTALLA -->
					<div class="media-block">
						<h4>Capturas de Pantalla</h4>
						<div class="media-grid">
							<div class="media-slot media-slot--image">
								<div class="media-placeholder">
									<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
										<rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"/>
										<circle cx="8.5" cy="8.5" r="1.5"/>
										<polyline points="21 15 16 10 5 21"/>
									</svg>
									<strong>Captura 1</strong>
									<span>Espacio reservado para imagen</span>
								</div>
							</div>

							<div class="media-slot media-slot--image">
								<div class="media-placeholder">
									<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
										<rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"/>
										<circle cx="8.5" cy="8.5" r="1.5"/>
										<polyline points="21 15 16 10 5 21"/>
									</svg>
									<strong>Captura 2</strong>
									<span>Espacio reservado para imagen</span>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</section>

				<div class="play-cta">
					<div class="cta-buttons">
						<a href="/#home" class="btn-play-now">
						<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg>
						IR AL HUB Y JUGAR
						</a>
						<a href="/game/build/coretaker/index.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-install-pwa" title="Abre el juego a pantalla completa para instalarlo como PWA en tu dispositivo">
							<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
								<path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path>
								<polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"></polyline>
								<line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"></line>
							</svg>
							ABRIR / INSTALAR PWA
						</a>
					</div>
					<p class="pwa-hint">
						<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" height="14" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 10 10A10 10 0 0 0 12 2zm1 15h-2v-6h2zm0-8h-2V7h2z"/></svg>
						Al abrirlo en ventana completa podrás instalarlo en tu pantalla de inicio o escritorio y jugar sin conexión.
					</p>
				</div>
			</article>

			<!-- FICHA TÉCNICA -->
			<aside class="sidebar-info">
				<div class="info-card">
					<h3>Ficha Técnica</h3>
					<dl class="tech-specs">
						<div>
							<dt>Desarrollador</dt>
							<dd>Ludik Studios</dd>
						</div>
						<div>
							<dt>Género</dt>
							<dd>Acción / Supervivencia</dd>
						</div>
						<div>
							<dt>Motor</dt>
							<dd>Unity WebGL</dd>
						</div>
						<div>
							<dt>Estado</dt>
							<dd class="status-active">Disponible</dd>
						</div>
						<div>
							<dt>Plataformas</dt>
							<dd>Web (PC & Mobile)</dd>
						</div>
						<div>
							<dt>Modo PWA</dt>
							<dd class="status-active">Instalable / Offline</dd>
						</div>
					</dl>
				</div>

				<!-- EQUIPO Y CONTACTO -->
				<div class="info-card">
					<h3>Equipo del Proyecto</h3>
					<ul class="team-list">
						<li class="team-member">
							<span class="member-role">Dirección & Game Design</span>
							<strong class="member-name">Alex Mercer</strong>
							<a href="mailto:alex.mercer@ludikstudios.com" class="member-contact">alex.mercer@ludikstudios.com</a>
						</li>
						<li class="team-member">
							<span class="member-role">Programación & Unity</span>
							<strong class="member-name">Valeria Ramos</strong>
							<a href="mailto:valeria.ramos@ludikstudios.com" class="member-contact">valeria.ramos@ludikstudios.com</a>
						</li>
						<li class="team-member">
							<span class="member-role">Arte & Animación 3D</span>
							<strong class="member-name">Diego Torres</strong>
							<a href="mailto:diego.torres@ludikstudios.com" class="member-contact">diego.torres@ludikstudios.com</a>
						</li>
						<li class="team-member">
							<span class="member-role">Audio & Música</span>
							<strong class="member-name">Elena Castillo</strong>
							<a href="mailto:elena.castillo@ludikstudios.com" class="member-contact">elena.castillo@ludikstudios.com</a>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
			</aside>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>

<style>
	:global(*) { box-sizing: border-box; }
	:global(body) {
		min-width: 320px;
		min-height: 100vh;
		color: #fff;
		background-color: #050b14;
		background-image:
			radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0%, rgba(26, 54, 110, 0.45), transparent 70%),
			linear-gradient(180deg, #050b14 0%, #091325 100%);
		font-family: 'Trebuchet MS', 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
	}

	.game-detail-shell {
		width: min(1100px, 100%);
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 32px 24px 64px;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 32px;
	}

	.btn-back {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 8px;
		color: #ffcb76;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-weight: 700;
		font-size: 14px;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.5px;
		transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
	}
	.btn-back:hover { opacity: 0.8; }

	.detail-header {
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
		padding-bottom: 24px;
	}
	.header-badge {
		font-size: 10px;
		font-weight: 900;
		color: #ffcb76;
		letter-spacing: 2px;
		margin-bottom: 8px;
	}
	.detail-header h1 {
		margin: 0;
		font-family: Impact, 'Arial Black', sans-serif;
		font-size: clamp(40px, 6vw, 64px);
		letter-spacing: 1px;
		line-height: 1;
	}
	.detail-header h1 em { color: #ffcb76; font-style: normal; }
	.tagline {
		margin: 12px 0 0;
		font-size: 16px;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
	}

	.detail-content {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 320px;
		gap: 36px;
	}

	.main-info h2, .main-info h3 {
		font-family: Impact, 'Arial Black', sans-serif;
		letter-spacing: 0.5px;
		color: #fff;
	}
	.main-info p {
		font-size: 15px;
		line-height: 1.7;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
	}
	.main-info ul {
		padding-left: 20px;
		margin: 16px 0 32px;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 10px;
	}
	.main-info li {
		font-size: 14px;
		line-height: 1.6;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
	}
	.main-info li strong { color: #ffcb76; }

	/* SECCIÓN MULTIMEDIA (VIDEOS E IMÁGENES) */
	.game-media-section {
		margin: 28px 0 36px;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 22px;
	}
	.game-media-section h3 {
		margin: 0;
	}
	.media-intro {
		margin: 0 !important;
		font-size: 14px;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7) !important;
	}
	.media-block {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 10px;
	}
	.media-block h4 {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 11px;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: #ffcb76;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 1px;
	}
	.media-slot {
		position: relative;
		border-radius: 8px;
		overflow: hidden;
		background: rgba(14, 27, 52, 0.5);
		border: 1px dashed rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
		transition: border-color 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease;
	}
	.media-slot:hover {
		border-color: rgba(255, 203, 118, 0.4);
		background: rgba(14, 27, 52, 0.7);
	}
	.media-slot--video {
		width: 100%;
		aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
	}
	.media-slot--image {
		aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
	}
	.media-slot :global(img),
	.media-slot :global(video),
	.media-slot :global(iframe) {
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		object-fit: cover;
		display: block;
		border: 0;
	}
	.media-placeholder {
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		gap: 8px;
		text-align: center;
		padding: 24px;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
	}
	.media-placeholder svg {
		color: #ffcb76;
		opacity: 0.85;
	}
	.media-placeholder strong {
		font-size: 14px;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
	}
	.media-placeholder span {
		font-size: 12px;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
	}
	.media-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
		gap: 16px;
	}
	@media (max-width: 600px) {
		.media-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}

	.play-cta {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 12px;
	}
	.cta-buttons {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 14px;
	}

	.btn-play-now {
		padding: 14px 28px;
		border-radius: 6px;
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffcb76 0%, #e5a438 100%);
		color: #071325;
		font-family: 'Arial Black', Impact, sans-serif;
		font-size: 14px;
		letter-spacing: 1px;
		text-decoration: none;
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 10px;
		box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(255, 203, 118, 0.3);
		transition: transform 0.2s ease;
	}
	.btn-play-now:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }

	.btn-install-pwa {
		padding: 14px 24px;
		border-radius: 6px;
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
		border: 1px solid rgba(255, 203, 118, 0.4);
		color: #ffcb76;
		font-family: 'Arial Black', Impact, sans-serif;
		font-size: 13px;
		letter-spacing: 1px;
		text-decoration: none;
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 10px;
		transition: background 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
	}
	.btn-install-pwa:hover {
		background: rgba(255, 203, 118, 0.15);
		border-color: #ffcb76;
		transform: translateY(-2px);
		color: #fff;
	}
	.pwa-hint {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 12px;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 6px;
	}
	.pwa-hint svg {
		color: #ffcb76;
		flex-shrink: 0;
	}

	.sidebar-info {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 24px;
	}

	.sidebar-info .info-card {
		padding: 24px;
		border-radius: 8px;
		background: rgba(14, 27, 52, 0.6);
		border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
		backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
	}
	.info-card h3 {
		margin: 0 0 16px;
		font-family: Impact, 'Arial Black', sans-serif;
		font-size: 18px;
		letter-spacing: 1px;
		color: #ffcb76;
	}
	.tech-specs {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 14px;
		margin: 0;
	}
	.tech-specs dt {
		font-size: 11px;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.5px;
	}
	.tech-specs dd {
		margin: 2px 0 0;
		font-size: 14px;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: #fff;
	}
	.status-active { color: #ffcb76 !important; }

	.team-list {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 16px;
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
		list-style: none;
	}
	.team-member {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 3px;
		padding-bottom: 12px;
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
	}
	.team-member:last-child {
		padding-bottom: 0;
		border-bottom: none;
	}
	.member-role {
		font-size: 11px;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.5px;
	}
	.member-name {
		font-size: 14px;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: #fff;
	}
	.member-contact {
		font-size: 12px;
		color: #ffcb76;
		text-decoration: none;
		word-break: break-all;
		transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
	}
	.member-contact:hover {
		text-decoration: underline;
		opacity: 0.85;
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.detail-content {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}
</style>
